  "updateinfo_id": "ALSA-2026:102175",
  "description": "The xdg-desktop-portal packages provide a portal front-end service to flatpak. Thesis service exposes a series of D-Bus interfaces known as portals under a well-known name (org.freedesktop.portal.Desktop) and object path (/org/freedesktop/portal/desktop). The portal interfaces include APIs for file access, opening URIs, printing and others.  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * xdg-desktop-portal: xdg-desktop-portal: Unauthorized host file access via unvalidated FileChooser filenames (CVE-2026-55888)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n",
